DESCRIPTION:Men in Harmony\nWith Men in Harmony at our a cappella vocal wo
 rkshops\, you can explore your vocal abilities by joining us for an intera
 ctive session that covers vocal training\, a cappella techniques\, and gro
 up singing tips. Our experienced director will guide you through the basic
 s of harmonizing\, breath control\, and performance skills. Get ready to d
 iscover the joy of making music together in a supportive environment. Come
  join us for an evening of fun songs and tags!\n**LOCATION\, DAY and TIME!
 **\nMission Cancer Center\, 21 Hospital Drive. NOT the main Hospital!\n**E
 ntrance to building parking is** on the Right side of the building\, off H
 amiton St. An **immediate LEFT is** where the BIG Parking lot is located. 
 Come into the building **on the floor level**\, into the lobby and there i
 s a corridor on the right where the conference rooms are. **We'll be rehea
 rsing in conference room R122.**\n**NOTE: Please be on time as the outer d
 oors will be locked after we start rehearsal.**
